WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:18.525
Batch enrollment prepares many devices before first boot.
Reserve names and serial numbers, then securely give each device
its own single-use credential during manufacturing. This avoids
registering large fleets one by one. For a production batch,
choose Enrollment in the sidebar.

2
00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:28.797
This recording reuses the confirmed batch policy created during
setup. On first use, choose the device limit and expiry, then
create the policy.

3
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:34.555
2. Reserve names and serial numbers: paste a roster CSV and
click Check.

4
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:41.040
Download the credentials: the only copy of the claim keys, for
your factory provisioning media.

5
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:48.181
Register the reserved devices and approve the request. Each
device then enrolls itself at first boot.

6
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:54.984
Claims are registered and waiting for their devices to enroll
with their installed client.

